      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9B54FF5E5462FF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但有件事我不太放心……\n魔尼尼它要第一次去收集信件了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
